                <pb facs="0721" n="709" sameAs="frus:frus1943v05/pg709"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">832.61333/903: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Counselor of Embassy in Brazil</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Simmons</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Rio de
                                Janeiro</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1943-12-31T13:00:00-03:00">December 31, 1943—1
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 5:04 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>5957. The Embassy will delay presentation of note (Department’s 4637, December
                    20, 12 p.m.) until we reach an understanding with the Brazilians on the ship
                    deal. Rich agrees.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Simmons</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
